  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new HUD is nice and all, but with a bunch of controls simply not existing when using controller (my preferred way of playing PC desktop VRChat), it just looks messy and incomplete. There are no controller bindings for the face mirror, 3rd person, or chat box. I think these should disappear from the HUD if on controller since you can’t access them anyway. Additionally, pressing the D-Pad with default controller configurations causes the HUD to flash, disappear, or display PC glyphs temporarily instead of controller glyphs. This whole update feels like a slap in the face for controller users.",
